<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sun Communities lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sun Communities lowered.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alex Brown said on Wednesday it lowered its rating on the shares of Sun Communities Inc to a buy from a strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock shed 1/2 to 35-3/4.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
